				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				70,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(deps): Update Rust dependencies in Cargo.toml\n\nThis commit updates several Rust crate dependencies in the project's Cargo.toml file. The changes include both version updates and new dependency additions aimed at improving functionality and maintaining compatibility with the latest versions.\n\nKey updates:\n- Updated `prost` from pinned version `0.13.5` to `0.14.3`, removing the strict version pin and allowing for more flexible version resolution.\n- Added `tonic-prost-build` and `tonic-prost` dependencies (both version `0.14.2`) to support Protocol Buffers integration with Tonic gRPC framework.\n- Reorganized dependency ordering: moved `fs_extra` (version `1.3.0`) to an earlier position in the list and placed `tonic-prost` at the end.\n- Downgraded `toml` from `0.9.11` to `0.9.8` and `toml_edit` from `0.24.0` to `0.23.9`, possibly to address compatibility issues or revert to more stable versions.\n\nThese dependency changes align with ongoing maintenance efforts to keep the Rust backend dependencies current and ensure proper integration between Tonic gRPC services and Protocol Buffers serialization.",
			"SHA": "db138b648b63749b031ddf1857d0e9f3cb8d9c5c"
		},
